sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 用户
    participant Browser as 浏览器
    participant Go as Go 后端
    participant MySQL as MySQL

    User->>Browser: 访问 /
    Browser->>Browser: Navigate to /news
    Browser->>Go: GET /api/news
    Go->>MySQL: SELECT * FROM news ORDER BY event_date DESC
    MySQL-->>Go: 快讯列表
    Go-->>Browser: JSON 响应 (gzip)
    Browser->>Browser: 渲染快讯卡片
    Browser->>Browser: 渲染诺贝尔里程碑
    Browser->>Browser: 渲染功能入口卡片(探索/AI/预测)
    Note over User,Browser: 首页加载完成
